.TH XUR.STD.STUB.RE.UNITY.TIME 7 "2026-10-30" "xur 0.1.2" "Xur Manual"
.SH NAME
xur.std.stub.re.unity.time \- Unity time control
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B use std::stub::re::unity::time;
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B std::stub::re::unity::time
reads and writes Unity's
.B Time.timeScale
and
.BR Time.deltaTime .
Useful for speed hacks and pause functionality.
.SH FUNCTIONS
.TP
.B scale() -> float
Get the current time scale (1.0 = normal speed).
.TP
.B set_scale(value: float) -> ()
Set the time scale. 0.0 pauses, 2.0 is double speed.
.TP
.B delta() -> float
Get the current frame delta time in seconds.
.TP
.B frame_count() -> int
Get Unity's frame count.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
use std::stub::re::unity::time;

// Pause the game
time::set_scale(0.0);

// Double speed
time::set_scale(2.0);

// Restore normal speed
time::set_scale(1.0);

// Read frame timing
let dt = time::delta();
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xur.std.stub.re.unity.egui (7),
